  "description": "Seryeong approaches the owner of Myowongak, the capital's finest guesthouse where wine and women's laughter never cease, to avenge her mother who was wrongfully killed 8 years ago. However, she faces an astonishing situation.\n\nOne is Lord Huimyeong, an Asura-like figure said to be the former king's illegitimate son, addicted to slaughter and intentionally starting wars. The other is Lee Hwieon, her sweet first love who misses their past together as the son of a gisaeng.\n\nHow could two different people possibly inhabit one body? Confused about what is true and whose words are facts, Seryeong soon finds herself at a crossroads.\n\nShould she share her body with Lord Huimyeong to awaken Hwieon, or not? She suspects this might just be another one of his games.\n\n\"If Hwieon doesn't awaken... I will hate you, My Lord.\"\n\nAll Seryeong could do was hope that her choice wasn't wrong.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/297090930)",
